T*
(Examples of questions this model supports) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
("State on September 16" resolves to the latest snapshot known to be in effect on September) Tj
T*
(16, supported by the crawl record for that date.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
("What changed on September 16?" resolves to the change detected by that crawl, or "no) Tj
T*
(change" if the crawl mapped to the existing state.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
("What changed between September 16 and September 18?" resolves the state in effect at each) Tj
T*
(date and compares those two states.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This is more direct than the historical overwrite policy, which loses prior state, and more) Tj
